    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d396">

                <pb facs="0608" n="520" xml:id="pg520"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr.
                            Dupuy de Lôme.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-09-26"><hi rendition="#italic">September 26,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 15th instant, and in reply to state that I have been
                    informed by the Acting Secretary of the Navy, in a letter dated the 23d instant,
                    that Rear-Admiral A. E. K. Benham, U. S. Navy, has been ordered to proceed to
                    Cadiz, Spain, with the United States flagship <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Newark</hi>, by the 8th of October next, and to accompany the Queen Regent
                    of Spain when she leaves that port for Huelva to dedicate the Columbus monument
                    at that city.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John W. Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
